      "prompt": "Rationalise the denominator of \\frac{11}{4 + √14}, giving your answer in its simplest form.",
      "solution_steps": [
        "Multiply the numerator and denominator by the conjugate of the denominator, (4 - √14):",
        "\\frac{11}{4 + √14}",
        "= \\frac{11(4 - √14)}{[(4 + √14)(4 - √14)]}",
